        "instruction": "Task:TC\nDataset:dbpedia\nWhat is the topic of the following paragraph? Choose one from the option.\nOption: Company, Educational Institution, Artist, Athlete, Office Holder, Mean of Transportation, Building, Natural Place, Village, Animal, Plant, Album, Film, Written Work \nTitle: USS Reform (AM-286)\nText:  USS Reform (AM-286) was an Admirable-class minesweeper built for the U.S. Navy during World War II. She was built to clear minefields in offshore waters and served the Navy in the Pacific Ocean before voyaging to the U.S. East Coast for decommissioning. Post-war her crew returned home proudly with three battle stars to their credit. The ship itself its wartime mission complete was given to China.\n\nAnswer:",
